# Server and Runtime Configuration
# The port where the local development server or Express proxy listens
PORT=3000

# Environment mode: development | production | test
NODE_ENV=development

# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for optional Gemini AI API features and NPC generation.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI or local .env file.
GEMINI_API_KEY="your-gemini-api-key-here"

# APP_URL: The base URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
# Used for self-referential links, asset loading, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Server-Side Session & Operator RBAC Security (server.ts / src/game/serverAuth.ts)
# VOXEL_SESSION_SECRET: 32+ character CSPRNG secret for HMAC-SHA256 HttpOnly session cookies.
# Recommended in production so sessions survive restarts; falls back to an ephemeral 256-bit CSPRNG key if omitted.
VOXEL_SESSION_SECRET="replace-with-at-least-32-char-csprng-secret"

# VOXEL_ADMIN_PASSKEY: Server-side operator passkey for POST /api/auth/admin-login (>= 12 chars).
# Operator login fails closed (HTTP 503) in production if unset; dev mode generates an ephemeral per-boot passkey.
VOXEL_ADMIN_PASSKEY="replace-with-strong-operator-passkey"

